      "writtenOn": "2017-10-19T17:29:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s not what this method is supposed to do. On each platform version, Android picks a single algorithm from the provided set. This method is supposed to return the set of picked algorithms for platform versions minSdkVersion-maxSdkVersion.\n\nHow to structure this method to achieve the above contract is the interesting bit. Previously, all v2-signature supporting platform versions picked exactly the same algorithm from the provided set. Thus, a simple loop over the set, looking for the alg Android would pick, was sufficient. Now that you\u0027re planning to introduce a change in Android P, we either need to have two such loops (pre-P and P+), or something else.",
      "revId": "ca0fb16b3692eb1c4e2929997956692bad42c7f1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
